# Civil War Strategy: the game starts with music and sound on, as the Union. Nothing is heard
# (script_mute, port/script.bm), but the tunes and beeps run and take their time: the title
# tune, the ironclads' announcement in January 1862, and the tune of an event that favors the
# Union in March (wealthy Unionists give, by forced dice). The notes are not checked.
#! seed 1862
#! cfg noise=2 bold=0
#! data jan-1862
#! dice 1;0,.9,.5,.1,.9
#! timeout 600

rule 1 key space
rule 2:E text y
rule 2:R key enter

# The title menu, after the title tune: Resume Saved Game; the Load menu: the one save.
play until 2:V
digest
text r
play until 2:L
key enter

# January and March 1862: END TURN.
repeat 2
play until 2:M
digest
text e
end

# May 1862. Files, Quit to DOS, Yes, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:M
digest
text f
prompt
text q
prompt
text y
repeat space
